{"name": "Europasaurus", "clade": "macronaria", "isd": true, "isnote": "Sander et al. (2006) placed it in Macronaria outside Brachiosauridae and Titanosauromorpha; the atlas backbone had listed it in Brachiosauridae and PBDB gives Camarasauromorpha; Macronaria is the clade all agree on.", "sum": "Europasaurus is a small macronarian sauropod from the Late Jurassic of northern Germany, regarded as an island dwarf.", "wsnote": "No body-length figure was read in the sources consulted; it is much smaller than other macronarians.", "holotype": "DFMMh/FV 291, a disarticulated but associated individual from the Langenberg quarry, Süntel Formation, Lower Saxony.", "material": "About 650 bones from at least several individuals found in an area of 60–80 m square; most specimens are adults.", "completeness": "multiple", "exceptional": "", "biology": "The 2006 study of bone histology showed that most specimens were adult, supporting insular dwarfism from isolation of a sauropod population on an island in the Lower Saxony basin.", "author": "Sander et al. 2006", "fad": 152.21, "lad": 149.2, "early": "Kimmeridgian", "late": "", "type_species": "Europasaurus holgeri", "pbdb_occ": 1, "species": [{"name": "Europasaurus holgeri", "author": "Sander et al. 2006", "fad": 152.21, "lad": 149.2, "interval": "Kimmeridgian", "ref": "original description"}], "formations": [{"ids": ["suntel-germany"], "formation": "Süntel", "group": "", "members": [], "country": "Germany", "regions": ["Niedersachsen"], "interval": "Late Kimmeridgian", "n": 1, "ma": [149.2, 152.21]}], "images": [{"kind": "life", "file": "Europasaurus holgeri scene modified.jpg", "src": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Europasaurus_holgeri_scene_modified.jpg/960px-Europasaurus_holgeri_scene_modified.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Europasaurus_holgeri_scene_modified.jpg", "artist": "Gerhard Boeggemann, anatomy corrected by FunkMonk", "license": "CC BY-SA 2.5", "licurl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.5", "date": "2006", "caption": "Scene with Europasaurus holgeri in life.", "w": 2500, "h": 1875, "local": null, "review": "unreviewed"}, {"kind": "life", "file": "Europasaurus TD.png", "src": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Europasaurus_TD.png/960px-Europasaurus_TD.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Europasaurus_TD.png", "artist": "TotalDino", "license": "CC BY 4.0", "licurl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0", "date": "2025-09-19", "caption": "Life restoration of Europasaurus.", "w": 2200, "h": 1400, "local": null, "review": "unreviewed"}, {"kind": "fossil", "file": "Europasaurus holgeri.jpg", "src": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/07/Europasaurus_holgeri.jpg/960px-Europasaurus_holgeri.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Europasaurus_holgeri.jpg", "artist": "Ghedoghedo", "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0", "licurl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0", "date": "2011-04-16", "caption": "Mounted skeleton of Europasaurus holgeri.", "w": 2162, "h": 2328, "local": null, "review": "unreviewed"}, {"kind": "fossil", "file": "Europasaurus skull.JPG", "src": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/Europasaurus_skull.JPG/960px-Europasaurus_skull.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Europasaurus_skull.JPG", "artist": "Nils Knötschke", "license": "CC BY-SA 2.5", "licurl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.5", "date": "2006", "caption": "Skull of Europasaurus.", "w": 2272, "h": 1704, "local": null, "review": "unreviewed"}, {"kind": "fossil", "file": "Europasaurus jaws.jpg", "src": "https://